Module tool_plans.py:
- define the bounded model-visible tool names
- include the category-based `list_item_ids` helper in the allowed tool set
- validate tool selection JSON from the model against a strict two-call-per-round contract
- accept common OpenAI-style aliases like `tool` and `args` when normalizing tool plans
- expose the JSON schema used for tool planning responses, using compact field descriptions to reduce prompt overhead
